      "filename": "Helictites (Cave of the Winds, Manitou Springs, Colorado, USA) (8317600624).jpg",
      "title": "File:Helictites (Cave of the Winds, Manitou Springs, Colorado, USA) (8317600624).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/Helictites_%28Cave_of_the_Winds%2C_Manitou_Springs%2C_Colorado%2C_USA%29_%288317600624%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Helictites_(Cave_of_the_Winds,_Manitou_Springs,_Colorado,_USA)_(8317600624).jpg",
      "width": 3008,
